  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "First, we remove the parentheses by distributing the negative sign. This gives\n\n$$\n4-2h+3\n$$\n\nFinally, we collect like terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4-2h+3 & = \\\\ (4+3)-2h & = \\\\ 7-2h & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
